./validation/client-runtime/scrutiny/reviews/client-retry-schedule-and-safety.json:        "description": "The Schedule does not own retry delay as required. Its addDelay callback performs the real wait through retryBackoff (including the legacy custom Promise sleep bridge) and then returns Duration.millis(-delayMs) at line 1441 to cancel the Schedule's own delay. This is precisely a parallel delay interpreter rather than Effect.retry + Schedule owning recurrence and delay; it also makes the retry timing/cancellation path split between Schedule and backoff.ts."
